  "title": "根据已知比例求代数式的值",
  "stem": "已知\\(\\frac { a } { 7 }=\\frac { b } { 8 }\\)，则\\(\\frac { b-a } { a }\\)的值为_________．",
  "choices": [],
  "figures": [],
  "tables": [],
  "given_answer": "\\(\\frac { 1 } { 7 }\\)",
  "answer": "\\(\\frac { 1 } { 7 }\\)",
  "given_solution": "【分析】此题主要考查了比例的性质，正确将已知变形是解题关键．\n设\\(a=7x,b=8x\\)，然后代入\\(\\frac { b-a } { a }\\)求解即可．\n【详解】\\(\\because \\frac { a } { 7 }=\\frac { b } { 8 }\\)，\n设\\(a=7x,b=8x\\)\n\\(\\therefore \\frac { b-a } { a }=\\frac { 8x-7x } { 7x }=\\frac { 1 } { 7 }\\)，\n故答案为：\\(\\frac { 1 } { 7 }\\)．",
  "given_solution_figures": [],
